	"data": "University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill — Computer Science (XR/VR Research)\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research.\n\nOverview\n\nUNC Chapel Hill's Department of Computer Science is one of the oldest and most respected CS departments in the US, and it holds a legendary position in VR/XR research. The VR Lab, founded by Henry Fuchs and Frederick Brooks (Turing Award winner), has been continuously operating since the 1960s — making it arguably the longest-running…",
